# Per-bot log/state dirs created by the OTHER two live bots, and by every
# backtest run (the harness imports the real bot modules, so their module-scope
# os.makedirs() fires with USER_ID/STRATEGY_ID = "backtest"). These were being
# deleted by hand after each run throughout this engagement -- ignoring the
# patterns is the durable fix. All generated artifacts; nothing here is source.
python_scripts/Intraday_Bot_Logs_*/
